<title>USA: 360 Communications started by Dillon Reed.</title>
<headline>360 Communications started by Dillon Reed.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dillon Reed &amp; Co said analysts William D. Vogel and Alexandra E. Kairis initiated coverage of 360 Communications Co with a buy rating.</p>
<p>In a research note, they cited management expertise in sustaining revenue growth, the firm's strong competitive position and confidence that margins are on track to improve.</p>
<p>Shares fell 1/8 to 24.</p>
</text>
